  "meta": {
    "probe": "ur-stencil",
    "target": "Underground Resistance lineage: black and steel plus one red, stencil-cut display type, text as coordinates and orders, no faces, no polish",
    "method": "stencil bridges are ground-coloured solid bars laid across silver text -- there is no mask primitive, so the cut is drawn on rather than taken out. Misregistration is real: the red pass is a second text op at an offset. No fragment is placed anywhere, so the no-faces rule is structural rather than stylistic."
  },
